connectives, and phrases such as 'each time' and 'as soon as'. Adjust
strength for capitalization, clause links, and nominal time references.
Recognize some split words and echo the marker on a following pronoun.
Document-initial 'When' has a separate positive baseline. Keep only a
short text tail, the previous token and prediction; reset at documents.
Other lexical collisions and fine context dependence are not modeled.
